lemetry-driven governance. Where compliance demands it, we deploy tenant-local infrastructure with strict network controls and KMS integrations so your inference and embedding pipelines remain under your control."}],["$","h5",null,{"className":"text-sm text-zinc-300 uppercase tracking-wider mb-2","children":"Core implementation patterns"}],["$","ul",null,{"className":"text-zinc-500 text-[13px] mb-4 space-y-2","children":[["$","li",null,{"children":"IaC modules (Terraform/ARM) with secure-by-default parameterization."}],["$","li",null,{"children":"Autoscaling inference clusters, batching and model tiering to reduce per-request cost."}],["$","li",null,{"children":"Telemetry for model drift, A/B evaluation and cost dashboards to enforce governance."}]]}],["$","h5",null,{"className":"text-sm text-zinc-300 uppercase tracking-wider mb-2","children":"Key benefits & KPIs"}],["$","ul",null,{"className":"text-zinc-500 text-[13px] space-y-2","children":[["$","li",null,{"children":"Lower inference costs: batching & caching commonly yield 25–50% reduction in per-request spend."}],["$","li",null,{"children":"Operational resilience: multi-zone failover and autoscaling meet enterprise RTO/RPO targets."}],["$","li",null,{"children":"Security posture: tenant-local deployments and KMS simplify SOC 2 / ISO 27001 evidence collection."}]]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-4 text-zinc-400 text-sm","children":["Read the deployment checklist in our ",["$","$L5",null,{"className":"underline text-blue-400","href":"/security","children":"Security Whitepaper"}]," or request a platform design review during your ",["$","$L5",null,{"className":"underline text-blue-400","href":"/assessment","children":"readiness assessment"}],"."]}]]}]
